From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:21:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] CB1: add HDR10 Raw FEL composition playback mode

Offer a fourth HDR10 method for Dolby Vision sources. It reconstructs
the picture exactly like HDR10 Rendering, including the FEL residual,
but asks the engine for its raw session: no tone mapping, no gamut
mapping, and static HDR10 metadata copied from the RPU L6 block.

The mode reuses HDR10 Basic admission and HDMI handling. Switching
between Basic and Raw during playback rebuilds the HDR10 session, since
both share one engine mode and the session would otherwise be reused.
---
